and decide nothing. \code{\link[=calc_clocks]{calc_clocks()}} reads the matrix again when it scores,
and \code{\link[=clocks_coverage]{clocks_coverage()}} gives what it counted. A clock whose weights are in
an asset is counted only when that asset is already in the assets
directory, or in \code{ext_data}. The report never downloads an asset. When
\code{DNAm} is given, \code{\link[=predict_sex]{predict_sex()}} also runs on it.

